/// * `hs_len` must be a multiple of 256.
/// * `hs` must contain independent uniform random octets. They are not secret under this contract.
/// * The bytes 0..14720, 26240..26496, 27008..27552, 27840..27992, 28672..40960, 40960..56672 of `ws` are unspecified on return.
/// * `ws` must not overlap `hs` (distinct Rust objects never do).
